cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MCP-Injector, the calibrated fault profile, or the released campaign data, please cite the paper (see preferred-citation) and, where you need to pin an exact artifact snapshot, the archived software record."
title: "MCP-Injector: protocol-level fault injection for tool-calling LLM agents"
abstract: "A protocol-aware, drop-in fault-injection middleware for the Model Context Protocol (MCP), together with a fault profile calibrated to the observed incident distribution of the public MCP ecosystem, the campaign runners for a 1,350-cell evaluation across three agent stacks, and the analysis pipeline that produced the figures and tables of the paper."
type: software
